Marker co-detection diagnostic
sample1_cells 6295
sample2_cells 5004
For each cell type, ge2 counts cells with at least two canonical markers detected; ratio_ge2 is sample2/sample1 after per-sample normalization.
Markers deliberately exclude ubiquitous MALAT1 and broadly neuronal NCAM1/SRGAP2/ISL1/CABP5 where they are not type-specific.
